{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/Wishlish.gif?t=1743218683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello, alien explorers! We are an independent development team of 2 people. We are excited to bring you Astral hunter : Homebound, a fast-paced action RougeLike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a unique fighting style</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take up arms and fight hordes of enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/WeaponChoice_E.gif?t=1743218683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/FightWithHorde.gif?t=1743218683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540610/extras/SuperWeapon.gif?t=1743218683\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies upgrade and modify your weapons or abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weaknesses are also strengths: Buy items to build the attributes you need and sacrifice those that aren't good for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Catching creatures, building pastures</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture creatures encountered in battle and use their abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are good 